Android port: mosaic and turned watermarks, text styles.

The watermark gets `font` (a style the host registers with `text::register_font`), `tile` (a mosaic over the whole photo,
rows offset by half a tile), `angle` (any turn, degrees clockwise) and `gap` (space between tiles). A mosaic or a turn by other
than quarter turns is drawn from a sprite by the inverse turn (`watermark_tile.rs`), so the edges stay smooth; whole quarter
turns without a mosaic take the old path. The text can be set in a registered font, with Inter behind it.
